.\" DO NOT MODIFY THIS FILE!  It was generated by help2man 1.49.3.
.TH XOURNALPP "1" "August 2026" "xournalpp 1.3.7" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
xournalpp \- open-source\ hand\ note-taking\ program
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.SS "Usage:"
.IP
com.github.xournalpp.xournalpp [OPTION???]
.SS "Help Options:"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help options
.TP
\fB\-\-help\-all\fR
Show all help options
.TP
\fB\-\-help\-gapplication\fR
Show GApplication options
.TP
\fB\-\-help\-gtk\fR
Show GTK+ Options
.TP
\fB\-\-help\-export\fR
Display advanced export options
.SS "Application Options:"
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-page\fR=\fI\,N\/\fR
Jump to Page (first Page: 1)
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Get version of xournalpp
.TP
\fB\-\-disable\-audio\fR
Disable audio for this session
.TP
\fB\-\-attach\-mode\fR
Open PDF in attach mode
Ignored if no PDF file is specified.
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-save\fR=\fI\,XOPPFILE\/\fR
Save xopp\-file with the background PDF specified as FILE
.TP
\fB\-\-display\fR=\fI\,DISPLAY\/\fR
X display to use
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-create\-pdf\fR=\fI\,PDFFILE\/\fR
Export FILE as PDF
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-create\-img\fR=\fI\,IMGFILE\/\fR
Export FILE as image files (one per page)
Guess the output format from the extension of IMGFILE
Supported formats: .png, .svg
.SH WEBSITE
Please visit our website https://xournalpp.github.io to learn about how to configure and use Xournal++ and where you can get help!
.SH PLUGINS
In order to use plugins you must have Lua 5.3 installed. A detailed description of how to write and use plugins is provided on the website.
.SH "ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES"
A custom "locale" directory for localization files can be specified via the enivronment variable $TEXTDOMAINDIR. 
